  "entity_type": "person",
  "description": "Having completed another residency at Amnesia Ibiza this summer, where he hosted his Metamorfosi parties, and marked 20 years in the game with the biggest hometown show of his career at Ex Base Nato in Naples, Joseph Capriati has remained as passionate about music since he first started mixing vinyl in the late ’90s.\n\nIn 2026 alone, he released on FCKNG SERIOUS, Defected, and his own imprint Metamorfosi Records. Blending bright and beachy house and winding techno across his output and DJ sets, the Italian artist has proved a versatile talent, with his sound (and tour schedule) refusing to stagnate.",
